    <item>
      <title>Participation Certificate for Udbhav 2009</title>
      <link>https://www.shafiq.in/blog/participation-certificate-for-udbhav-2009/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Mar 2009 11:14:03 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.shafiq.in/blog/participation-certificate-for-udbhav-2009/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;A participation certificate for Udbhav 2009. Same design problem as the Respograph one — make it feel official without looking like a template. This one had to sit within the wider Udbhav visual identity, so the palette and typography carried through from the posters and banners.&lt;/p&gt;





  
  &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.shafiq.in/wp-content/uploads/2009/03/certi-4-copy10010_hu_249736af0c5ad492.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Udbhav 2009 participation certificate&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34; class=&#34;&#34; /&gt;


&lt;p&gt;This was part of a larger design effort for Udbhav 2009 that also included &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.shafiq.in/blog/posters-for-udbhav-2009/&#34;&gt;posters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.shafiq.in/blog/udbhav-2009-flyers/&#34;&gt;flyers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.shafiq.in/blog/udbhav-2009-stickers/&#34;&gt;stickers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.shafiq.in/blog/mini-banners-for-udbhav-2009-events/&#34;&gt;mini banners&lt;/a&gt;, the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.shafiq.in/blog/book-cover-for-udbhav-2009-souvenir/&#34;&gt;souvenir book cover&lt;/a&gt;, and the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.shafiq.in/blog/backdrop-for-udbhav-2009/&#34;&gt;stage backdrop&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
